59:55.052 --> 59:57.758
<i>Para pengemudi</i>
<i> berputar bersama-sama.</i>

59:58.259 --> 01:00:00.759
Ayo, 45!

01:00:00.862 --> 01:00:03.925
KOMENTATOR:<i> Andy Garcia </i>
<i> masih dalam hal ini.</i>

01:00:04.027 --> 01:00:06.800
-Oh!
-KOMENTATOR: Andy Garcia!

01:00:08.138 --> 01:00:09.770
<i>Ini dia...</i>

01:00:10.270 --> 01:00:11.640
SEMUA: Oh!

01:00:12.506 --> 01:00:13.703
