01:00:13.806 --> 01:00:15.605
-Oh!
-KOMENTATOR: <i> Pukulan hebat!</i>

01:00:15.707 --> 01:00:17.710
<i>Belum menyerah begitu saja.</i>

01:00:17.812 --> 01:00:20.242
<i>Oh, kupikir</i>
<i>roda belakang itu sudah tidak ada gunanya.</i>

01:00:21.018 --> 01:00:21.944
DAWN: Ya!

01:00:22.046 --> 01:00:23.178
KOMENTATOR: <i>Dia bagus.</i>
<i>Dia harus</i>

01:00:23.280 --> 01:00:25.418
