01:46:32.884 --> 01:46:34.479
STEPHEN QUADROS:<i>Satu hal</i>
<i>yang harus saya perhatikan</i>

01:46:34.581 --> 01:46:35.980
<i>adalah hati Mark,</i>

01:46:36.082 --> 01:46:38.022
<i> karena kami telah melihat banyak</i>
<i> tap out</i>

01:46:38.124 --> 01:46:39.189
<i> di turnamen ini.</i>

01:46:39.291 --> 01:46:40.853
<i>Tapi Mark jatuh dengan pedangnya</i>

01:46:40.955 --> 01:46:43.427
<i> di hadapan</i>
<i>ribuan penggemarnya.</i>

01:46:43.530 --> 01:46:45.995
